# --- POLICY ------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file controls what Vercel publishes. The first line `/*` ignores
# EVERYTHING at the repo root; each `!path` below opts a file or folder back
# in. See AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md and .cursor/rules/vercelignore.mdc for the
# full rules. Never remove the `/*` line. Never replace it with narrower
# patterns. Never add patterns that re-include the whole repo (e.g. `!*`).
# Ordering inside a chained re-include block matters; do not reorder lines.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

